  "b4_text_layer_sanitized": "49\nA wire carrying a current I along the positive x-axis has length L. It is kept in a magnetic field B⃗ = (2î\n+ 3ĵ - 4k̂) T. The magnitude of the magnetic force acting on the wire is :\n(1)\n√3 IL\n(2)\n√5 IL\n(3)\n5 IL\n(4)\n3 IL\n\n3\n​ −\nj^\n4k^\n×\nL\n=\nB\nL ×\ni^\n(2 +\ni^\n3\n​ −\nj^\n4 ) =\nk^\nL(0 + 3 +\nk^\n4\n​) =\nj^\nL(4\n​ +\nj^\n3 )\nk^\nF = IL\n​ =\n4 + 3\n2\n2\n5IL\n",
